# Backend Conventions

## Structure

Routes → Services → Repositories. Prisma client and repositories live in `src/db/` (prisma.ts, repositories). Controllers/routes in `src/routes/`, business logic in `src/services/`.

## Prisma

- Use `include` or `select` to avoid N+1 queries.
- Supervisors are Chercheur: include `supervisor` (from supervision_supervisors), not user.
- Prefer explicit types from `@prisma/client` or project types in `src/types/`.

## Errors and Responses

Use centralized error middleware; return consistent HTTP status and response shape (e.g. success/error payloads from `src/utils/response.ts`).

## Auth and RBAC

JWT verification in auth middleware. Four roles: ADMIN, DIRECTOR, TEACHER, ASSISTANT. Role checks in roleMiddleware where needed.

